     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m proud to present a new pair of activities that allows us to model a rollercoaster process: batch and separate. These are basically the antithesis of clone/synchronize, and the four of them cover all the features of Arena&#39;s batch/separate blocks with further improvements.</div><div><br></div><div>See <a href=\"https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/45\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/45&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467960513000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2hPI4D8TTd5NBlBU5lBmbU\">#45</a> for more details and check out the master branch if you wish to test them.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards,<br>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\">Iñaki Úcar<br><a href=\"http://www.enchufa2.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.enchufa2.es&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467960514000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1pnkzEpmziG9G6Gwauhs2U\">http://www.enchufa2.es</a><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/#%21/Enchufa2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/%23%2521/Enchufa2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467960514000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zyrk7acnHBlrQy81aPbA1\">@Enchufa2</a><br></div>\r\n</div></div>\r\n"
